@dc:description "A description bundle for the model ontologies."
description bundle <http://www.example.com/project/bundle#> as d-bundle {
    uses <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/> as dc
    includes <http://www.example.com/project/access-models/access-profiles#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/project/access-models/entitlements#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/project/access-models/roles#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/project/connections/application-sources#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/project/identity-management/accounts#>
    includes <http://www.example.com/project/identity-management/identities#>
}
